{
  "format": "call-of-slop-construct-part/1",
  "name": "Grow Former",
  "description": "A Grow Former Core: grows a wheel, a prop or a wing on its hub, by its Makes setting or by order. Weld Former Blocks on the floor beside it for its bed and stack Mast Blocks on it for height: a wheel's width fits the bed's length and its diameter the bed's width and the masts plus 2 m; a prop is up to twice the bed's width; a wing's chord fits across the bed and its span runs along it and on over Run-out Tables. Needs power.",
